      "portrait": "American realistic comic book style portrait illustration of a 41-year-old Chinese man, present-day northern China, a mountain lodge electrician and maintenance mechanic, lean build, short cropped black hair with a few grey strands, tired deep-set eyes, light stubble, crow's feet and deep lines beside the mouth, dark blue work jacket with the sleeves pushed up and a small screwdriver in the chest pocket, calm reserved expression, bold ink linework, expressive painterly shading, cold teal and amber palette, half-length shot",
